	<h2>News &amp; Events</h2>
		<ul>
		<li>8 May 2026: Ivan Shanin was awarded the ICASSP 2026
			Best Student Paper Award for the paper
			<a href="pub/2026/ShaninEtAl-ICASSP2026.pdf">
			Audio-to-Score Jazz Solo Transcription with the Rhythm Perceiver
			</a>
			by Ivan Shanin, Xavier Riley and Simon Dixon, at the 2026 IEEE
			International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing
			</li>
		<li>15 December 2025: Huan Zhang passed her PhD viva on
			<a href="phd/HuanZhang-PhD-Thesis.pdf">
			Computational Modeling of Expressive Piano Performance:
			Understanding, Generation and Assessment
			</a></li>
		<li>13 November 2025: Yin-Jyun (Jun) Luo passed his PhD viva on
			<a href="phd/YinJyunLuo-PhD-Thesis.pdf">Towards Robust and
