			George Fazekas, received the best student paper award at the
			ISMIR 2025 conference, for their paper
			<a href="https://ismir2025program.ismir.net/poster_7.html">
			Audio Synthesizer Inversion in Symmetric Parameter Spaces with
			Approximately Equivariant Flow Matching
			</a>. Two other AIM papers were also among the seven papers
			shortlisted for an award.</li>
		<li>10 September 2025: <a href="https://aim.qmul.ac.uk">AIM</a>
